 678:tinyusb/src/common/tusb_fifo.c ****     @brief Advance write pointer - intended to be used in combination with DMA.
 679:tinyusb/src/common/tusb_fifo.c ****     It is possible to fill the FIFO by use of a DMA in circular mode. Within
 680:tinyusb/src/common/tusb_fifo.c ****     DMA ISRs you may update the write pointer to be able to read from the FIFO.
 681:tinyusb/src/common/tusb_fifo.c ****     As long as the DMA is the only process writing into the FIFO this is safe
 682:tinyusb/src/common/tusb_fifo.c ****     to use.
 683:tinyusb/src/common/tusb_fifo.c **** 
