 706:tinyusb/src/common/tusb_fifo.c ****     It is possible to read from the FIFO by use of a DMA in linear mode. Within
 707:tinyusb/src/common/tusb_fifo.c ****     DMA ISRs you may update the read pointer to be able to again write into the
 708:tinyusb/src/common/tusb_fifo.c ****     FIFO. As long as the DMA is the only process reading from the FIFO this is
 709:tinyusb/src/common/tusb_fifo.c ****     safe to use.
